OL,3,GNEWSARail passengers urged to plan
OL,4,Aahead for bank holiday
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers in the north-west of
OL,7,FEngland are being advised to plan their
OL,8,Fjourneys ahead of the bank holiday
OL,9,Fweekend as several major events are set
OL,10,Fto take place across the region.
OL,12,FCreamfields music festival returns to
OL,13,FDaresbury in Cheshire on Thursday and
OL,14,Fruns to Sunday, while Manchester
OL,15,FVillage Pride will take place from
OL,16,FFriday until Monday.
OL,18,FThe new Premier League football season
OL,19,Falso continues, with Liverpool hosting
OL,20,FNottingham Forest on Saturday and
OL,21,FManchester United taking on Ipswich
OL,22,FTown at Old Trafford on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
